33-34. Distinguished. ~ EMINENT
35-36. A crystalline compound contained in animal and vegetable fats. ~ STEARIN
17-3. Words and music. ~ ARIA
18-4. They come before Christmas. ~ EVES
19-3. A supplication. ~ PLEA
20-5. You have ten. ~ TOES
4-23. Complete assortments. ~ SETS
6-24. A commotion. ~ STIR
5-21. A bristle. ~ SETA



